% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: an image mask paints the current colour. The mask is an
% XObject flagged as such with no colour space; the Separation is
% selected in the content stream before the mask is drawn. The tint
% transform stays within the calculator subset.
[/Separation /Spot /DeviceCMYK {0 0 0 4 -1 roll}] setcolorspace
0.6 setcolor
100 100 translate
50 50 scale
2 2 true [2 0 0 -2 0 2] <4080> imagemask
showpage
